{"kind": "mod", "id": 1878, "name": "Unrestricted Armor Plate", "slug": "unrestricted-armor-plate", "teaser": "Allows to insert any Armor Plate into any Armored Chest Rig​ or Armor Vest​.", "owner_name": "FiveF", "downloads": 21383, "favourites": 24, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.fivef.unrestrictedarmorplate", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Equipment", "category_id": 15, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:54:45.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-12-09T00:22:33.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-12-09T00:22:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.x", "latest_version": "2.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>This is mainly for ArmorPlate, but also works on BuiltInInserts.<br />\n \nBuiltInInserts is disable by default. You can enable it in config.jsonc file.\n </p>\n<p><strong>Armor plates</strong> are divided into <strong><code>front+back</code></strong>, <strong><code>side</code></strong>.<br />\n<strong>BuiltInInserts</strong> are divided into <strong><code>front+back</code></strong>, <strong><code>side</code></strong>, <strong><code>groin</code></strong>, <strong><code>shoulder</code></strong>, <strong><code>collar</code></strong>.<br />\n<strong>BuiltInInserts</strong> for <strong>helmets</strong> are divided intro <strong><code>top</code></strong>, <strong><code>back</code></strong>, <strong><code>ears</code></strong>.</p>\n<p>To get build-in you need take it from other armor/rig - there are no option to buy build-in.<br />\nPMC’s wills spawn with random available build-in, if BuiltInInserts are enabled.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/oV9Soun\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Example preview</a><br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/4btyIhZ\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Example preview 2</a></p>\n<p><strong>Issues</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The quest <code>Sew it Good - Part 2</code> is easier to complete if BuiltInInserts are enabled.</li>\n<li>At least one armor (BNTI Zhuk body armor (Press)) uses armorPlateColliders from two systems at once (Plate_Granit_SAPI_chest, Plate_Korund_chest)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>How to install</strong>:<br />\nDrop the contents of <code>FiveF-unrestrictedArmorPlate-2.0.0.zip</code> to the path of SPT.</p>\n<p><strong>Hot to uninstall</strong>:<br />\nDelete <code>FiveF-unrestrictedArmorPlate</code> folder from <code>SPTarkov400\\SPT\\user\\mods\\</code>.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2696, "published_at": "2025-01-26T10:43:42.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1878/unrestricted-armor-plate/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 905, "published_at": "2025-03-16T06:30:55.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1878/unrestricted-armor-plate/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5996, "published_at": "2025-03-23T09:32:02.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1878/unrestricted-armor-plate/1.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.x", "content_length": 15109, "downloads": 744, "published_at": "2026-01-05T14:30:25.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1878/unrestricted-armor-plate/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown"